---
import {type Airport,price,traffic} from '../data/airports';
import {brandEditorial,planTradeoff} from '../data/brand-editorial';
import Promotion from './Promotion.astro';
import PlanSelector from './PlanSelector.astro';
import BrandPeers from './BrandPeers.astro';
import BrandEvidence from './BrandEvidence.astro';
import BrandDecision from './BrandDecision.astro';
const {airport:a}=Astro.props as {airport:Airport};const e=brandEditorial[a.slug];
const directory=[['overview','品牌概览'],['evidence','本次资料核对'],['plans','套餐与预算'],['fit','适合与不适合'],['pros','推荐依据'],['limits','关键局限'],['client','设备与使用条件'],['coupon','优惠与入口'],['compare','交叉比较'],['sources','来源与更新']];
---
<div class="article-layout dossier-layout"><article class="prose dossier"><BrandDecision airport={a}/>
<BrandEvidence airport={a}/><h2 id="plans">套餐结构与预算取舍</h2>{a.plans.length?<><div class="table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label={`${a.name} 月付参考套餐`}><table><caption>已收录月付参考档 · 未计优惠，非实时在售保证</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">档位</th><th scope="col">参考月费</th><th scope="col">标称月容量</th><th scope="col">资料口径</th></tr></thead><tbody>{a.plans.map(plan=><tr><th scope="row">{plan.name}</th><td>{price(plan)}</td><td>{traffic(plan)}</td><td>{plan.notes??(plan.verified?'套餐资料已核实':'第三方资料 · 当前在售与结算待确认')}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p>“参考档”是本站整理标识，不一定是官方命名；表中仅列已收录方案，不代表完整价目表或市场最低价。</p><div class="editor-note"><strong>怎么判断升档是否值得</strong><p>{e.decision}</p><p>{planTradeoff(a)}</p></div><PlanSelector airport={a}/></>:<div class="dossier-evidence"><strong>先核对当前服务，再谈套餐价格</strong><p>{e.decision}</p><p>{a.purchaseCheck}</p></div>}
<h2 id="fit">适合谁，也有哪些不匹配的需求</h2><div class="fit-grid"><section class="fit-panel"><span class="fit-label">可以列入候选</span><p>{e.audience}</p></section><section class="fit-panel caution"><span class="fit-label">建议先排除疑点</span><p>{e.avoid}</p></section></div>
<h2 id="pros">推荐原因与资料所能支持的优点</h2><p>{a.recommendation}</p><ol class="reason-list">{a.advantages.map((item,i)=><li><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><p>{item}</p></li>)}</ol>
<h2 id="limits">这家品牌最需要澄清什么</h2><div class="editor-note caution"><strong>资料冲突与条件限制</strong><p>{a.sourceNotes}</p></div><h3>付款前的具体核对项</h3><p>{a.purchaseCheck}</p>
<h2 id="client">客户端、线路与任务条件</h2><div class="spec-grid">{[['线路 / 协议','尚未核实'],['设备 / 并发','尚未核实'],['AI 应用','本站未实测'],['流媒体 / 片库','本站未实测']].map(([label,value])=><div><span>{label}</span><strong>{value}</strong></div>)}</div><p>先确认当前服务是否提供自有客户端或通用订阅，再核对系统版本和设备限制。容量够用不等于客户端兼容，能打开网页也不等于目标应用的全部功能可以使用。</p><p><a href="/guides/">查看四平台使用指南</a> · <a href="/blog/ai-access/">AI 条件检查</a> · <a href="/blog/streaming-checklist/">流媒体验证方法</a></p>
<h2 id="coupon">当前入口与指定优惠码</h2><Promotion airport={a}/><p>{a.coupon?`优惠码 ${a.coupon} 由站长提供。折扣、期限、新老用户、适用套餐及续费规则以当前订单提示为准，复制成功不表示优惠已生效。`:'本品牌没有站长指定的优惠码，页面保留原始推广地址；邀请码与优惠码不能混用。'}</p>
<h2 id="compare">与其他品牌交叉核对</h2><BrandPeers airport={a}/><h2 id="sources">引用来源与更新说明</h2><p>查询日期：<time datetime={a.lastVerified}>{a.lastVerified}</time>。这是资料整理日期，不等于原始价格生效日、当前结算核验日或测速日期。</p><div class="source-cards">{a.sources.map((url,i)=><a href={url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>参考资料 {i+1}</span><strong>{new URL(url).hostname}</strong><small>查看套餐原文与上下文 ↗</small></a>)}</div><p>资料差异与缺口按<a href="/editorial-policy/">编辑政策</a>保留。发现价格或套餐变化，可附当前官方说明到<a href="/contact/">纠错渠道</a>。</p><div class="dossier-next"><a class="button secondary" href={`/review/${a.slug}/`}>阅读购买决策分析 →</a><a class="button secondary" href="/airport/">返回 29 品牌目录</a></div></article><aside class="sidebar"><div class="sidebar-inner"><h2>品牌详情目录</h2>{directory.map(([id,label])=><a href={`#${id}`}>{label}</a>)}<div class="sidebar-brief"><strong>{a.name}</strong><p>{e.positioning}</p><a class="button detail-button" href={`/compare/?brands=${a.slug}`}>加入对比 →</a></div></div></aside></div>
